OL,3,GNEWSAMore than third of deaths of
OL,4,Aex-prisoners on probation drug related,
OL,5,Asays report
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than a third of deaths of former
OL,8,Fprisoners on probation in Wales in a
OL,9,Fyear were drug related, according to a
OL,10,Fnew report.
OL,12,FThis was higher than across England and
OL,13,FWales combined, where just over a fifth
OL,14,Fof total deaths were drug related.
OL,16,FThe Wales Governance Centre at Cardiff
OL,17,FUniversity published the report and
OL,18,Furged politicians to tackle "systematic
OL,19,Ffailures" in the criminal justice
OL,20,Fsystem.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
